{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53057","headline":"奉同秘书苗丞菘阳山闲居引 · 吉中孚","name":"奉同秘书苗丞菘阳山闲居引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有山𨁟兮有水潺湲，王孙独往兮春草经年\n溪路独行兮到时何处？\n渔父相见兮水上天边。\n犬吠前村兮极浦，回风入林兮微月映户。\n白石磷磷兮曲（小川氏疑爲「迸」字）水泥（疑）衣，哀猿啾啾兮空山半雨。\n谷口苍茫兮天阴，人间离别兮年月深。\n花迷流水不知处，心忆君家难得（小川氏定爲「後」）寻。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉中孚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}